{
  "scene_id": "dana_b3_first_truth",
  "start_node": "n1",
  "nodes": {
    "n1": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Dana is on the roof after midnight.)",
      "next": "n2"
    },
    "n2": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(No clipboard. No lanyard.)",
      "next": "n3"
    },
    "n3": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You know the roof is not an approved interview space.”",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    "n4": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Neither is your kitchen.”",
      "next": "n5"
    },
    "n5": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You use that one anyway.”",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    "n6": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“The coffee is better.”",
      "next": "n7"
    },
    "n7": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Thora heard that.”",
      "next": "n8"
    },
    "n8": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Good.”",
      "next": "n9"
    },
    "n9": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(She has taken the lanyard off and wrapped it around one hand.)",
      "next": "n10"
    },
    "n10": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“The rulebook isn't cruelty.”",
      "next": "n11"
    },
    "n11": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“I didn't say it was.”",
      "next": "n12"
    },
    "n12": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“You think it.”",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    "n13": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Sometimes.”",
      "next": "n14"
    },
    "n14": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Rules exist because the first year after the Gatefall was chaos.”",
      "next": "n15"
    },
    "n15": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“People made exceptions until nobody knew what an exception was.”",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    "n16": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“And you were there.”",
      "next": "n17"
    },
    "n17": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Junior caseworker.”",
      "next": "n18"
    },
    "n18": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I still believed good intentions counted as qualifications.”",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    "n19": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“What happened?”",
      "next": "n20"
    },
    "n20": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "(Looks at the city.)",
      "next": "n21"
    },
    "n21": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“South Intake Annex Four.”",
      "next": "n22"
    },
    "n22": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“I don't know it.”",
      "next": "n23"
    },
    "n23": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Most people don't.”",
      "next": "n24"
    },
    "n24": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“It was temporary housing for Gatekin who could not be classified fast enough.”",
      "next": "n25"
    },
    "n25": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Temporary became nine months.”",
      "next": "n26"
    },
    "n26": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“That sounds familiar.”",
      "next": "n27"
    },
    "n27": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Yes.”",
      "next": "n28"
    },
    "n28": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“One family was going to be split across three sites.”",
      "next": "n29"
    },
    "n29": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I knew a volunteer transport coordinator.”",
      "next": "n30"
    },
    "n30": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I knew a shelter with unofficial capacity.”",
      "next": "n31"
    },
    "n31": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I knew which supervisor would not check until Monday.”",
      "next": "n32"
    },
    "n32": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You moved them.”",
      "next": "n33"
    },
    "n33": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I arranged it.”",
      "next": "n34"
    },
    "n34": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“And?”",
      "next": "n35"
    },
    "n35": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“A surge hit the transit corridor.”",
      "next": "n36"
    },
    "n36": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(Silence.)",
      "next": "n37"
    },
    "n37": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“People were hurt.”",
      "next": "n38"
    },
    "n38": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Two did not make it.”",
      "next": "n39"
    },
    "n39": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“The family?”",
      "next": "n40"
    },
    "n40": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“One of them.”",
      "next": "n41"
    },
    "n41": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Dana—”",
      "next": "n42"
    },
    "n42": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“The official route had also been hit.”",
      "next": "n43"
    },
    "n43": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“What?”",
      "next": "n44"
    },
    "n44": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“If I had followed procedure, they might have died there instead.”",
      "next": "n45"
    },
    "n45": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Or lived.”",
      "next": "n46"
    },
    "n46": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I will never know.”",
      "next": "n47"
    },
    "n47": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“What did the inquiry say?”",
      "next": "n48"
    },
    "n48": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“That I exceeded authority.”",
      "next": "n49"
    },
    "n49": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Which was true.”",
      "next": "n50"
    },
    "n50": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“And you decided never again.”",
      "next": "n51"
    },
    "n51": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I decided that if something failed, it would fail inside a process designed to survive failure.”",
      "next": "n52"
    },
    "n52": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“So it wouldn't be yours.”",
      "next": "n53"
    },
    "n53": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "(Sharp look.)",
      "next": "n54"
    },
    "n54": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“That's what this is.”",
      "next": "n55"
    },
    "n55": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“No.”",
      "next": "n56"
    },
    "n56": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Armor.”",
      "next": "n57"
    },
    "n57": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“The rulebook is armor.”",
      "next": "n58"
    },
    "n58": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“For them?”",
      "next": "n59"
    },
    "n59": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Yes.”",
      "next": "n60"
    },
    "n60": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“For you?”",
      "next": "n61"
    },
    "n61": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "(Long pause.)",
      "next": "press_cb1"
    },
    "press_cb1": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You care more than you let on.”",
      "condition": {
        "requires_flags": [
          {
            "flag": "DANA_APPROACH",
            "equals": "press"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "press_cb2"
    },
    "press_cb2": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“You really enjoy being consistent.”",
      "condition": {
        "requires_flags": [
          {
            "flag": "DANA_APPROACH",
            "equals": "press"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "patience_cb1"
    },
    "patience_cb1": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“You can pretend you didn't hear any of this.”",
      "condition": {
        "requires_flags": [
          {
            "flag": "DANA_APPROACH",
            "equals": "patience"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "patience_cb2"
    },
    "patience_cb2": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“I can.”",
      "condition": {
        "requires_flags": [
          {
            "flag": "DANA_APPROACH",
            "equals": "patience"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "patience_cb3"
    },
    "patience_cb3": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“You won't.”",
      "condition": {
        "requires_flags": [
          {
            "flag": "DANA_APPROACH",
            "equals": "patience"
          }
        ]
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "choice_id": "ask",
          "text": "“What did caring cost you after the inquiry?”",
          "next": "ask1",
          "effects": {
            "set_flags": {
              "DANA_ARMOR_KNOWN": true
            },
            "bond_delta": 15
          }
        },
        {
          "choice_id": "gentle",
          "text": "“You don't have to turn the worst day of your career into a confession tonight.”",
          "next": "gentle1",
          "effects": {
            "set_flags": {
              "DANA_ARMOR_KNOWN": true
            },
            "bond_delta": 10
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask1": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Promotion.”",
      "next": "ask2"
    },
    "ask2": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Friends.”",
      "next": "ask3"
    },
    "ask3": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“A year under review.”",
      "next": "ask4"
    },
    "ask4": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“And the ability to hear 'use your judgment' without feeling sick.”",
      "next": "ask5"
    },
    "ask5": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“That's a lot.”",
      "next": "ask6"
    },
    "ask6": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Not compared to two people.”",
      "next": "ask7"
    },
    "ask7": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You don't have to compare grief by weight.”",
      "next": "ask8"
    },
    "ask8": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I work for a government office.”",
      "next": "ask9"
    },
    "ask9": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“We compare everything by weight.”",
      "next": "n62"
    },
    "gentle1": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“You think I'm confessing?”",
      "next": "gentle2"
    },
    "gentle2": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“You took the lanyard off.”",
      "next": "gentle3"
    },
    "gentle3": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“That is not a recognized evidentiary standard.”",
      "next": "gentle4"
    },
    "gentle4": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Still noticed.”",
      "next": "gentle5"
    },
    "gentle5": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "(Looks at the lanyard in her hand.)",
      "next": "gentle6"
    },
    "gentle6": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Maybe another night.”",
      "next": "gentle7"
    },
    "gentle7": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Okay.”",
      "next": "n62"
    },
    "n62": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I don't hate the rules.”",
      "next": "n63"
    },
    "n63": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“I know.”",
      "next": "n64"
    },
    "n64": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“I hate that people use them to avoid choosing.”",
      "next": "n65"
    },
    "n65": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Do you?”",
      "next": "n66"
    },
    "n66": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "(Looks at you.)",
      "next": "n67"
    },
    "n67": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Good night.”",
      "next": "n68"
    },
    "n68": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "“Coward.”",
      "next": "n69"
    },
    "n69": {
      "speaker": "dana",
      "text": "“Landlord.”",
      "next": "n70"
    },
    "n70": {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "(She puts the lanyard in her pocket instead of back around her neck.)",
      "next": "end"
    },
    "end": {
      "end_scene": true
    }
  }
}
